 will try to solve the anxieties and fears of well-known characters who turn to them, looking for them in the most diverse places in the city. Professional actors will confess with irony and sincerity their tics and their manias hoping that these \"psychiatric tutors\" will be able to solve them thus facing problems and disorders that affect the daily life of each of us. The film wants to reveal with lightness, originality and with a surreal and tragicomic irony high psychological and social contents with the aim of staging a different way of seeing and facing the problems and difficulties, physical and mental, that we all try to overcome and improve in different ways."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wim8jt6tZwOqQaVX4KwvXs8GoMJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wim8jt6tZwOqQaVX4KwvXs8GoMJ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3DVNFcnLoUvBlTWIgdcoEPtCFiF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3DVNFcnLoUvBlTWIgdcoEPtCFiF.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gcC1v2sTWrTsNQ2lxtx6OEvCM6k.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gcC1v2sTWrTsNQ2lxtx6OEvCM6k.jpg","language":"xx","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/DA9fZ0piWGAe0u6SxUJxJ2hmFY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/DA9fZ0piWGAe0u6SxUJxJ2hmFY.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wim8jt6tZwOqQaVX4KwvXs8GoMJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/DA9fZ0piWGAe0u6SxUJxJ2hmFY.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1321660,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/